{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_title", "source_sha256": "b4ea0b919a594451b9569c54c95a0c32d30ddb07d5cb04718ae09433187604b4", "ja": "アイドル in 弾丸ツアー", "zh": "偶像特快之旅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "635358a47029df497c3389d7d029ffbe2b2f26b5a3de2ea1b9c83d5ca5e32252", "ja": "ハードスケジュールな観光を終え、新潟市内\nに戻った春香、のり子、亜利沙、美奈子。\nプロデューサーは疲れ切ってしまったが、\nアイドル達はまだまだこれからだと、\n次の目的地を決めるのだった。", "zh": "结束高强度的观光行程后，春香、诺莉子、亚利沙、美奈子回到了新潟市内。\n制作人已经精疲力竭，但偶像们却觉得接下来才刚刚开始，于是决定了下一个目的地。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8ce452110358295639b42e00d1ec8ad5d68c9a1a2748109f55ca20d91c644373", "ja": "（ようやく、新潟市内に戻ってきた……。\nなかなかハードな観光スケジュールだったが……）", "zh": "（终于回到新潟市里了……。\n虽然这趟观光的行程相当紧凑……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "6a170ef702e253a3895f796b66e42751461ac0a3890a0ce47448f12c07b622e8", "ja": "魚市場でお昼を食べて、パワースポットの\n神社でお参り！　楽しかったね～♪", "zh": "在鱼市场吃午饭，再去能量景点的神社参拜！玩得很开心呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "708067af9f5b413fc8eb5634b559f2ccaf538680e777168a4f33607fed893821", "ja": "海鮮料理、すっごく美味しかった！　アタシは\nお肉が好きだけど、たまにはお魚もいいもんだね♪", "zh": "海鲜料理超级好吃！虽然我喜欢吃肉，\n但偶尔吃吃鱼也很不错呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "a9843bf92c748c1413d9bdde8b8eb59f0eadbae444bce8f85981933df24bf23e", "ja": "神社も最高でしたよ！　参拝するみなさんの美しい\n横顔、しっかりカメラに収めました！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "神社也棒极了！　参拜的大家那美丽的侧脸，我都好好地收进镜头里了！　嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "cdd38c52bc0e199317b239a71f500273c5fa2470ed500d2c24bfd7e73e4c655a", "ja": "{$P$}さんもお疲れさまです！\nこの後はイタリアンを食べて、ゆっくりしましょう！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也辛苦了！\n接下来吃点意大利菜，然后好好休息吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5a2221f46f3b053a4bc833c25a80c5e5fdab0dc09db9a1f6f98a1a6923c49226", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。……新潟に、そんなに有名な\nイタリアンレストランがあるのか？", "zh": "啊，谢谢。……新潟还有这么有名的意大利餐厅吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "e084834cedace818f10f43d3e8f1b302e4389b46029f465fab1d0e7e1904936c", "ja": "レストランじゃなくて、いわゆるご当地フードです！\nこういうのは、やっぱり現地で食べないと！", "zh": "不是餐厅，而是所谓的当地美食！\n这种东西果然还是得在当地吃才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "4648c05910e04546461a1fafb4edea98131e175e302e8673f322b0457e046f03", "ja": "その後は、温泉でラストだね！\nご飯を食べたら、急いで移動しなくちゃ！", "zh": "之后就去温泉，作为最后一站吧！\n吃完饭后，得赶紧出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3901c0ea4ede6af3f58ad75821221ce8d268581cf0016054655234c33a0c9154", "ja": "えっ！？　イタリアンを食べて、\n最後じゃないのか……？", "zh": "诶！？吃完意大利菜，\n不是最后一项吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "78694c4056742bf32a5ef40e7482c1b7e394e6b64cc3668ef93a2fd3b6e9bfe4", "ja": "せっかく4人のスケジュールが空いたんだよ？\n弾丸ツアーしてでも、新潟を楽しみ尽くさなきゃ！", "zh": "好不容易腾出了4人的行程啊？  \n就算来个闪电之旅，也得把新潟玩个尽兴才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "beb0c190824cd57edccbd6553d2e0b87ddaf0659a5c7c7f28148dce377128027", "ja": "はい！　今から行く温泉は、\n美人の湯として名高いと聞きました……。", "zh": "是的！听说我们现在要去的温泉，是闻名遐迩的美人汤……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "f7d3e305da07d19e3dfae4e82e7fdcfddf9bf656a42f8fd70b682a9c385530f9", "ja": "ありさもアイドルの端くれ、\nす、少しでも、綺麗になれたら……！", "zh": "亚利沙好歹也算个偶像，\n要、要是能变得稍微漂亮一点的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "dca16a68ec2b6d087816b8932405f2a3255335f88c0e08a0f94485f12514b2f3", "ja": "なるほど……。アタシもこういうところで、\nか、かわいさを上げておかないとね！", "zh": "原来如此……我也得在这种地方，\n稍、稍微提升一下可爱度才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "910e90d8aeacffc2db463fa7cf3ffce7b98eec378fe2bfec073e11f4b7e3fc15", "ja": "それなら、私も置いてかれるわけにはいかないな！\n温泉、楽しみだね♪", "zh": "既然这样，我也不能被落下啊！\n好期待温泉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "e62b854ecca7997447c8e5b8e84958e77e9aa37eb3d8da5653c2d80a2a712997", "ja": "みんなで新潟を楽しみ尽くして、美人になっちゃおう！\nもちろん{$P$}さんも、ですよ♪", "zh": "大家一起把新潟玩个痛快，然后变成大美人吧！\n当然{$P$}先生也是哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7f59df10bbafa5e32dc05556842bebecbb7503ba4251ab767fbf9d09d5bb464e", "ja": "（この美意識の高さ……アイドルとして素晴らしい\n限りだ！　俺も、最後まで付き合わないとな！）", "zh": "（这份审美意识……真不愧是偶像，实在太棒了！我也必须陪她们到最后才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
